    {
      "id": "u_2ef87dfc59c46165f3156c75_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once the __TRILIUM_PH_0__AI__TRILIUM_PH_1__ integration is activated, a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Chat__TRILIUM_PH_3__ entry will appear in the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "2ef87dfc59c46165f3156c7586473ea2b4a67fa460f15c54099db4752f103beb",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81b049c756ccd2dd75ceda93_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Unlike the dedicated note type, the side bar has optional access to the current note, making it easy to ask for information or modifications to a note without having to search for the note first.",
      "sourceHash": "81b049c756ccd2dd75ceda93714a513a0f4818f276e1fe0b3a5c78d466b9bebb",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45db53fcc28c014f56cf72d7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To toggle whether the current note is visible to the AI, simply click on the file icon at the bottom of the chat interface.",
      "sourceHash": "45db53fcc28c014f56cf72d70f6e95e97b12d15d905d7cc417d41fd1fed3f66e",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9e5e320dd05c85689dbc456c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the top-right of the sidebar there are three buttons:",
      "sourceHash": "9e5e320dd05c85689dbc456c0055b962daf0ec8a7d432c1c468f228b8e5f4268",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5943e0c6f5af7c626eddadcc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ creates a new conversation.",
      "sourceHash": "5943e0c6f5af7c626eddadccb764e8fb222ce6adfeb30eef49fa3a8aac971d39",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bd846efc5659f1254307b4b5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ goes to a previous conversation.",
      "sourceHash": "bd846efc5659f1254307b4b5e67227ad59119ad750d11ab3a74a583020ee205b",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cf7e31ba866349264e9db042_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ opens a menu to rename or delete the current conversation, or to save it as a dedicated note in the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Day Notes__TRILIUM_PH_2__, which turns it into a dedicated chat note.",
      "sourceHash": "cf7e31ba866349264e9db04233f021013b09decd4f2307e04ed26e80b769898a",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_70f07644b582b9703105a5c2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The sidebar chats are stored in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Hidden Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and can be seen in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI Chat History__TRILIUM_PH_3__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "70f07644b582b9703105a5c2ae2c586bc095f6912973de2918e6c14fbe461b48",
      "context": "AI chat tab",
      "contextHash": "833cf2f5704ba220954fb2c444395f603124d5d4d4821821733b8c101383981f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_155cfb2d8cfd2b36b9358101_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Mobile__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
