    {
      "id": "u_b8a566b9ce212a730ef1d191_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On mobile, the chat is the __TRILIUM_PH_0__AI chat__TRILIUM_PH_1__ tab of the note panel (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_3__). Its buttons are in the header of the sheet:",
      "sourceHash": "b8a566b9ce212a730ef1d191b7c6a39c40c851ffa8365cd51aff7baf19822214",
      "context": "AI chat tab > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "46f896da18f671230901170b1a95f3b93dfc1b9f0cdccca501e26e5a41abe864",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c1ac7eb93ba5e32ff6be929e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ on the left creates a new conversation.",
      "sourceHash": "c1ac7eb93ba5e32ff6be929e5670b8cb87cb4772f8966cc0653a29100d8ee789",
      "context": "AI chat tab > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "46f896da18f671230901170b1a95f3b93dfc1b9f0cdccca501e26e5a41abe864",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1c79dafefe03beea0de7feb6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The title of the current conversation, in the middle, lists the previous conversations when tapped.",
      "sourceHash": "1c79dafefe03beea0de7feb64f3f2094315c5f2142e1a34766bc8f33ad288cc2",
      "context": "AI chat tab > Mobile",
      "contextHash": "46f896da18f671230901170b1a95f3b93dfc1b9f0cdccca501e26e5a41abe864",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8746b1ef4153292743801e6e_0",
